    <string name="tool_packages_summary">Install packages from the VESC package store: board firmware add-ons, displays, lights, BMS support</string>
    <string name="packages_intro">A package is a LispBM program, often with settings and a screen, that runs on the controller. Installing one replaces whatever package or script is on it now. Packages for other hardware are hidden unless you show them.</string>
